  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1022431,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## T8 Snake - A Commodore 64 Classic!\n\n**Slither into a world of challenge and addictive gameplay with *T8 Snake*!**\n\nYou are a ravenous serpent, driven by an insatiable hunger for delicious apples. Navigate vibrant, increasingly complex levels, gobbling up every apple you can find. With each bite, your snake grows longer, presenting a thrilling new layer of difficulty! Ten apples consumed unlocks the gateway to the next, even more demanding level.\n\nBut beware! This isn't just about eating. A single collision with an obstacle or even your own ever-expanding body means instant defeat. Precision and quick reflexes are your greatest allies. \n\n*T8 Snake* offers:\n\n*   **Simple yet addictive gameplay:** Easy to learn, impossible to master!\n*   **Challenging levels:** Test your skills with increasingly intricate designs.\n*   **Growing danger:** Your snake gets longer, making navigation trickier.\n*   **Commodore 64 graphics:** Experience classic visuals and vibrant colours.\n\n**Can you conquer all ten levels and become the ultimate snake? Get *T8 Snake* today!**"
    },
